00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:04.780
Now, on a population, on a raw numbers basis,
they are less populated areas.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:10.190
But on a per capita basis, if you look at
economic deprivation, underinvestment in government,

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.230
bad, terrible

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:16.940
resources, bad infrastructure, you know, all
